{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes:\nEspresso is a curious gentleman who loves good food, sunny naps, and plenty of affection!Though he can be a little cautious at first, Espresso warms up quickly once he feels safe. He spends his days birdwatching by the window and mastering the art of sunbathing. When he's not chasing lasers, string, or toy balls, he's eagerly waiting for mealtime. Espresso isn't a traditional lap cat, until the pets start! Once you begin scratching his favorite spots, he'll happily climb onto your lap or arm to ensure maximum snuggle coverage.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=13&searchType=4&animalid=208538","id":"b9df99db1537a95b9b38585856cdea33","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/2d9f0f6039ea494dac8f11a1fb174c96-1793286680-1793286746-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/efeb547c39b541f9817be2fc8fa890d0-1793286681-1793286681-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/75bc4f5a49a04dd290e64808a30eb16c-1793286681-1793286681-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/d62729e6c25e4c2282aa872edb6999ca-1793286680-1793286680-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/435028682eee41aa8e9e26f08f986bb5-1793286680-1793286680-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/2af8500de71646798cfbfb944e373bca-1793286679-1793286679-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/3282f1c901c54d758371039efc860aac-1793286679-1793286679-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/de39c4bfb7b5440eb4212d7d78896644-1793286678-1793286678-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/5